{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"AutoGen的ConversableAgent与GroupChat设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"AutoGen的ConversableAgent与GroupChat设计\" dir=\"auto\">AutoGen的ConversableAgent与GroupChat设计</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细解释AutoGen框架的核心设计理念，特别是ConversableAgent的设计以及GroupChat多Agent群聊机制的工作原理。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AutoGen的核心理念：对话即交互</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AutoGen由微软研究院开发，其设计理念是\"<strong>一切皆交互</strong>\"（Conversation as Code）。Agent之间通过自然语言消息传递实现协作，而非传统的函数调用或状态机。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心Agent类型：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Agent类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ConversableAgent</strong></td>\n<td>基础对话Agent，可通过LLM生成回复</td>\n<td>所有对话场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>AssistantAgent</strong></td>\n<td>AI助手Agent，依赖LLM执行任务</td>\n<td>代码生成、分析、写作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>UserProxyAgent</strong></td>\n<td>用户代理，可执行代码和工具</td>\n<td>代码执行、人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>GroupChat多Agent群聊机制：</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">GroupChat是AutoGen实现多Agent协作的核心组件，多个Agent围坐在\"虚拟圆桌\"旁，由GroupChatManager决定下一个发言人。</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">GroupChat架构\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│           GroupChatManager              │\n│    (决定下一个发言人的调度器)              │\n└─────────────┬───────────────────────────┘\n              │ LLM调用/轮询策略\n┌─────────────┴───────────────────────────┐\n│           GroupChat                     │\n│  ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐  │\n│  │ Agent A │ │ Agent B │ │ Agent C │  │\n│  │(程序员) │ │(测试员) │ │(架构师) │  │\n│  └────┬────┘ └────┬────┘ └────┬────┘  │\n│       └───────────┼───────────┘        │\n│                   │ 消息传递            │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：构建代码审查团队</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> autogen\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> autogen <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> UserProxyAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> GroupChat<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> GroupChatManager\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 配置LLM</span>\nconfig_list <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"model\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"api_key\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"your-api-key\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建代码分析Agent</span>\ncode_analyzer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"代码分析专家\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是一位资深代码分析专家，负责分析代码质量和架构设计。\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"发现代码问题时，请详细说明问题位置和修改建议。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建安全审查Agent</span>\nsecurity_expert <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"安全专家\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是一位安全审计专家，负责检查代码中的安全漏洞，\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"如SQL注入、XSS、敏感信息泄露等。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建性能优化Agent</span>\nperformance_engineer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AssistantAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"性能工程师\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是一位性能优化专家，负责识别代码中的性能瓶颈，\"</span>\n                   <span class=\"token string\">\"如N+1查询、内存泄漏、算法复杂度问题。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"temperature\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建用户代理（触发讨论并汇总结果）</span>\nuser_proxy <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> UserProxyAgent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"项目经理\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    system_message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"你是项目经理，负责发起代码审查并汇总各专家意见。\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    human_input_mode<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"NEVER\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    max_consecutive_auto_reply<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建群聊</span>\ngroupchat <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GroupChat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    agents<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>user_proxy<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> code_analyzer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> security_expert<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> performance_engineer<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    max_round<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">12</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 最大对话轮数</span>\n    speaker_selection_method<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 自动选择下一个发言人</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建群聊管理器</span>\nmanager <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> GroupChatManager<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    groupchat<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>groupchat<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    llm_config<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"config_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> config_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 发起代码审查</span>\nuser_proxy<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>initiate_chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    manager<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"请审查以下Python函数，从质量、安全和性能三个角度分析：\\n\\n\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"```python\\n\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"def get_user_data(user_id):\\n\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"    query = f'SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = {user_id}'\\n\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"    result = db.execute(query)\\n\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"    return result.fetchall()\\n\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"```\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>GroupChatManager的发言人选择策略：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">auto</code></td>\n<td>LLM根据对话上下文选择最合适的下一个发言人</td>\n<td>动态讨论场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">round_robin</code></td>\n<td>轮询，每个Agent依次发言</td>\n<td>平等参与场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">random</code></td>\n<td>随机选择</td>\n<td>头脑风暴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义函数</td>\n<td>用户定义选择逻辑</td>\n<td>特殊业务需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：GroupChat在Agent数量较多时有什么风险？如何控制？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：风险包括Token消耗激增、对话偏离主题、Agent互相附和。控制方法：限制<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">max_round</code>；精简Agent数量（3-5个最佳）；精心设计System Message；使用termination条件提前结束。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：AutoGen的Human-in-the-loop是如何实现的？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：通过<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">human_input_mode</code>参数控制，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">ALWAYS</code>每轮都征求人工输入，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">TERMINAL</code>在关键节点暂停，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">NEVER</code>完全自动运行。<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">UserProxyAgent</code>可以配置在特定条件下触发人工介入。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：AutoGen的群聊是多个Agent并行运行。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：GroupChat是顺序发言机制，每个时刻只有一个Agent在说话，由Manager决定发言顺序。Agent之间通过消息历史共享信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}